&lt;h3&gt;


  🔒 Privacy Philosophy
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I built Mouzi because I couldn't find a file organizer that didn't want to upload my file names to some cloud or charge a subscription. Mouzi is built on three principles:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
