&lt;strong&gt;Local-first&lt;/strong&gt; — everything runs on your machine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Open source&lt;/strong&gt; — transparent and auditable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Zero friction&lt;/strong&gt; — no accounts, no paywalls, no features locked behind payments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

